---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="作品集" description="项目与成果图展示">
  <header class="page-header">
    <p class="kicker">Portfolio</p>
    <h1>作品集</h1>
    <p>项目与成果图展示。</p>
  </header>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-heading"><h2>代表项目</h2></div>

    <article class="project-card">
      <div class="project-head">
        <h3>rtl-lab</h3>
        <a href="https://github.com/helloworld-dlx/rtl-lab" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="repo-button" aria-label="在 GitHub 查看 rtl-lab">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 .7a11.5 11.5 0 0 0-3.64 22.4c.58.11.79-.25.79-.56v-2.2c-3.22.7-3.9-1.36-3.9-1.36-.53-1.34-1.29-1.7-1.29-1.7-1.05-.72.08-.7.08-.7 1.17.08 1.78 1.2 1.78 1.2 1.04 1.78 2.72 1.27 3.39.97.1-.75.4-1.27.74-1.56-2.57-.29-5.27-1.29-5.27-5.73 0-1.27.45-2.3 1.2-3.12-.12-.3-.52-1.48.11-3.08 0 0 .98-.31 3.16 1.19a10.9 10.9 0 0 1 5.76 0c2.19-1.5 3.16-1.19 3.16-1.19.63 1.6.23 2.78.11 3.08.75.82 1.2 1.85 1.2 3.12 0 4.45-2.71 5.43-5.29 5.72.42.36.79 1.06.79 2.14v3.18c0 .31.21.68.8.56A11.5 11.5 0 0 0 12 .7Z"/></svg>
          <span>GitHub</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="card-desc">Verilog 数字设计与综合成果整理仓库，记录 E5 阶段和数电课设中形成的独立实验、波形截图、综合观察。目前暂停，等 E5 完成和数电课设定题后重新规划。</p>
    </article>

    <article class="project-card">
      <div class="project-head">
        <h3>ysyx-prestudy</h3>
        <a href="https://github.com/helloworld-dlx/ysyx-prestudy" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="repo-button" aria-label="在 GitHub 查看 ysyx-prestudy">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 .7a11.5 11.5 0 0 0-3.64 22.4c.58.11.79-.25.79-.56v-2.2c-3.22.7-3.9-1.36-3.9-1.36-.53-1.34-1.29-1.7-1.29-1.7-1.05-.72.08-.7.08-.7 1.17.08 1.78 1.2 1.78 1.2 1.04 1.78 2.72 1.27 3.39.97.1-.75.4-1.27.74-1.56-2.57-.29-5.27-1.29-5.27-5.73 0-1.27.45-2.3 1.2-3.12-.12-.3-.52-1.48.11-3.08 0 0 .98-.31 3.16 1.19a10.9 10.9 0 0 1 5.76 0c2.19-1.5 3.16-1.19 3.16-1.19.63 1.6.23 2.78.11 3.08.75.82 1.2 1.85 1.2 3.12 0 4.45-2.71 5.43-5.29 5.72.42.36.79 1.06.79 2.14v3.18c0 .31.21.68.8.56A11.5 11.5 0 0 0 12 .7Z"/></svg>
          <span>GitHub</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="card-desc">一生一芯预学习阶段的学习记录与代码仓库，包含 C 语言手搓的 RISC-V 指令集模拟器（minirvEMU）以及 Verilog RTL 实现探索。</p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <h2>成果图</h2>
      <span>点击图片可放大查看</span>
    </div>

    <article class="evidence-card">
      <div class="evidence-copy">
        <h3>RISC-V 处理器仿真结构图</h3>
        <p>基于 Logisim 仿真的 8 条指令迷你 RISC-V 处理器（minirv），最终可以打印出"一生一芯"图标。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="portfolio-grid single">
        <img src="/portfolio-riscv-struct.png" alt="32位 RISC-V 处理器核心模块结构图" class="portfolio-img clickable" data-full="/portfolio-riscv-struct.png" />
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="evidence-card">
      <div class="evidence-copy">
        <h3>STC89C52RC 51单片机核心板</h3>
        <p>使用嘉立创EDA设计的51单片机核心板，USB-C供电、3.3V稳压、12MHz晶振、双层PCB布局，配有完整复位电路、用户LED与按键，全部GPIO引出排针。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="portfolio-grid">
        <img src="/portfolio-51-pcb-3d.png" alt="51单片机核心板 PCB 3D渲染图" class="portfolio-img clickable" data-full="/portfolio-51-pcb-3d.png" />
        <img src="/portfolio-51-pcb-layout.png" alt="51单片机核心板 PCB 走线图" class="portfolio-img clickable" data-full="/portfolio-51-pcb-layout.png" />
        <img src="/portfolio-51-schematic.png" alt="51单片机核心板 原理图" class="portfolio-img clickable" data-full="/portfolio-51-schematic.png" />
      </div>
    </article>
  </section>


  <div id="lightbox" class="lightbox" role="dialog" aria-modal="true">
    <button type="button" class="lightbox-close" aria-label="关闭">&times;</button>
    <img id="lightbox-img" src="" alt="" />
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<script>
  const lightbox = document.getElementById('lightbox');
  const lightboxImg = document.getElementById('lightbox-img');
  const closeBtn = document.querySelector('.lightbox-close');

  if (lightbox && lightboxImg instanceof HTMLImageElement && closeBtn instanceof HTMLButtonElement) {
    const close = () => lightbox.classList.remove('active');

    document.querySelectorAll('.portfolio-img.clickable').forEach(img => {
      img.addEventListener('click', () => {
        if (!(img instanceof HTMLImageElement)) return;
        lightboxImg.src = img.dataset.full || img.src;
        lightboxImg.alt = img.alt;
        lightbox.classList.add('active');
      });
    });

    closeBtn.addEventListener('click', close);
    lightbox.addEventListener('click', event => {
      if (event.target === lightbox) close();
    });
    document.addEventListener('keydown', event => {
      if (event.key === 'Escape') close();
    });
  }
</script>

<style>
  .page-header {
    max-width: 44rem;
    padding: 3.5rem 0 2rem;
  }

  .kicker {
    color: var(--color-accent-strong);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.09em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .page-header h1 {
    margin: 0.35rem 0 0.4rem;
    font-size: 2rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .page-header > p:last-child { color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: 0.88rem; }
  .section { padding: 1.2rem 0 2.2rem; }

  .section-heading {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .section-heading h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 1.15rem; }
  .section-heading span { margin-left: auto; color: var(--color-text-faint); font-size: 0.68rem; }

  .project-card,
  .evidence-card {
    margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
    padding: 1.3rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--color-surface);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
  }

  .project-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .project-head h3,
  .evidence-copy h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 1.05rem; }

  .repo-button {
    margin-left: auto;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.34rem;
    padding: 0.36rem 0.62rem;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 26%, var(--color-border));
    border-radius: 0.48rem;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent-soft) 46%, var(--color-surface));
    color: var(--color-accent-strong);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.15s, border-color 0.15s, background 0.15s;
  }

  .repo-button svg { width: 0.9rem; height: 0.9rem; }
  .repo-button:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    background: var(--color-accent-soft);
    color: var(--color-accent-strong);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .card-desc,
  .evidence-copy p { margin: 0; color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: 0.84rem; line-height: 1.7; }

  .portfolio-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .portfolio-grid.single { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 26rem); }

  .portfolio-img {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;
    object-fit: cover;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 0.55rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: opacity 0.15s, transform 0.15s;
  }

  .portfolio-img:hover { opacity: 0.88; transform: translateY(-1px); }


  .lightbox {
    display: none;
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 1000;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 2rem;
    background: rgba(8, 12, 15, 0.9);
  }

  .lightbox.active { display: flex; }
  .lightbox img { max-width: min(92vw, 1200px); max-height: 90vh; border-radius: 0.65rem; }
  .lightbox-close { position: absolute; top: 1rem; right: 1.3rem; border: 0; background: transparent; color: #fff; font-size: 2rem; cursor: pointer; }

  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .portfolio-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .portfolio-grid.single { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .project-head { align-items: flex-start; }
  }
</style>
